 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p>Your birth came from someone from the Kamo clan, and from experimentation, your blood became poisonous. As a reaction, when you take piercing or slashing damage, you can choose a creature within 5 feet of you to take poison damage equal to your proficiency bonus. If the creature has an injury or less than their maximum hit points, they must make a DC 10 Constitution save or be poisoned until the end of their next turn.</p>",
